<view class="container game-page">
  <view class="topline">
    <text class="game-kicker">思维闯关 · 01</text>
    <text class="title-badge">路径 / 环</text>
  </view>
  <view class="title-row">
    <text class="game-title">抓狐狸</text>
    <text class="title-badge">2 关</text>
  </view>
  <view class="game-lead">每天查一个洞；你查完，狐狸会沿相邻的洞跑掉。路径上有必胜策略，环上却不一定。</view>

  <view class="seg-row">
    <view class="seg warm {{level === 1 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-level="1" bindtap="setLevel">路径 · P5</view>
    <view class="seg warm {{level === 2 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-level="2" bindtap="setLevel">环 · C5</view>
  </view>

  <view class="fox-hero {{caught ? 'caught' : (lost ? 'lost' : '')}}">
    <text class="fox-emoji">{{caught ? '🎯' : (lost ? '💨' : '🦊')}}</text>
    <view class="fox-copy">
      <text class="fox-state">{{caught ? '抓到了！' : (lost ? '狐狸跑了' : '狐狸藏在某个洞里')}}</text>
      <text class="fox-sub">{{caught ? '路径/环上的策略成功了。' : (lost ? '天数用完，再试一次。' : '点一个洞开始排查；她每天晚上会挪一次。')}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="status-line">
    <text class="status-strong">第 {{state.day}} / {{state.maxDay}} 天</text>
    <text class="mono">已查 {{state.checked.length}} 次</text>
  </view>
  <view class="progress-track">
    <view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{state.day * 100 / state.maxDay}}%;"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="holes">
    <view class="hole {{item.checked ? 'checked' : ''}} {{item.last ? 'last' : ''}} {{item.fox ? 'fox' : ''}}" wx:for="{{holes}}" wx:key="label" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="check" hover-class="press">
      <text class="hole-num">{{item.label}}</text>
      <text class="hole-icon">{{item.fox ? '🦊' : (item.checked ? '✓' : '·')}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions-row">
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="showHint">提示</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="restart">重开</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint-box">{{hint}}</view>

  <view class="rule-box">
    <view class="rule-title">为什么路径和环不同</view>
    <view class="rule-text">路径是一条链，从一端向另一端扫，总能把狐狸逼到端点；环没有端点，奇偶性不匹配时可能永远差一格。</view>
  </view>
</view>
